WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.776
Module two. Message templates. Wo pre-approved messages jinke bina aap conversation

2
00:00:06.776 --> 00:00:08.288
Shuru nahi kar sakte.

3
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:14.316
API pe business kisi ko bhi koi bhi text nahi bhej sakta.

4
00:00:14.316 --> 00:00:19.805
Customer ko pehla message aise template se jaana chahiye jise Meta ne approve kiya

5
00:00:19.805 --> 00:00:25.294
Ho. Isse customers spam se bachte hain, aur Oribrix ka number block hone se bachta

6
00:00:25.294 --> 00:00:25.561
Hai.

7
00:00:26.011 --> 00:00:27.953
Pehle, templates kyun hote hain.

8
00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:30.472
Phir teen template categories.

9
00:00:30.922 --> 00:00:33.567
Phir template banana, field by field.

10
00:00:34.017 --> 00:00:36.428
Phir variables, buttons aur preview.

11
00:00:36.878 --> 00:00:40.739
Aur aakhir mein, Meta approval aur har status ka matalba.

12
00:00:43.133 --> 00:00:47.119
Har template teen mein se kisi ek category mein hona chahiye.

13
00:00:47.119 --> 00:00:52.477
Sahi category chunna zaroori hai, kyunki Meta inhe alag price aur check karta hai.

14
00:00:52.927 --> 00:00:59.016
Utility. Zaroori updates aur notifications jinki customer ko ummid hai, jaise order

15
00:00:59.016 --> 00:01:03.124
Confirmed, dispatched ya delivered, ya payment received.

16
00:01:03.574 --> 00:01:09.176
Marketing. Kuch bhi promotional. Offers, naye products, festive sale, ya chup ho

17
00:01:09.176 --> 00:01:12.257
Chuke customer ko vaapas laane wala message.

18
00:01:12.707 --> 00:01:18.680
Authentication. Sirf one-time passwords ke liye, jaise login ya verification code.

19
00:01:21.066 --> 00:01:26.301
Utility template ke andar offer chhupakar use sasta banane ki koshish mat kijiye.

20
00:01:26.301 --> 00:01:31.213
Meta content check karta hai aur use marketing category mein daal sakta hai.

21
00:01:31.213 --> 00:01:36.384
Aur agar campaign ke bich mein template ki category badal jaaye, toh platform wo

22
00:01:36.384 --> 00:01:40.714
Campaign rok deta hai, jisse baaki customers ko message nahi jaata.

23
00:02:18.233 --> 00:02:20.537
Naya template aise banate hain.

24
00:02:20.987 --> 00:02:26.509
Manage kholiye, phir Template messages. Alag industries ke liye ready-made templates

25
00:02:26.509 --> 00:02:29.072
Hain, jinse aap shuruat kar sakte hain.

26
00:02:29.522 --> 00:02:33.448
Ya apna banane ke liye top right pe New pe click kijiye.

27
00:02:33.898 --> 00:02:38.848
Category, language, aur name chuniye. Name sirf aapke reference ke liye hai.

28
00:02:38.848 --> 00:02:43.732
Customers ise kabhi nahi dekhte. Order dispatched jaise clear naam rakhiye.

29
00:02:44.182 --> 00:02:48.534
Header type chuniye: text, image, video, carousel ya document.

30
00:02:48.984 --> 00:02:52.910
Body likhiye, optional footer jodiye, aur buttons jodiye.

31
00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:57.498
Right side pe preview check kijiye, phir Submit pe click kijiye.

32
00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:02.396
Fields ko thoda karib se dekhte hain.

33
00:03:02.846 --> 00:03:07.156
Body text one thousand twenty four characters tak ho sakta hai.

34
00:03:07.156 --> 00:03:09.139
Ise chhota aur clear rakhiye.

35
00:03:09.589 --> 00:03:14.561
Variables, jo double curly brackets mein numbers ki tarah likhe jaate hain, har

36
00:03:14.561 --> 00:03:19.469
Customer ke liye bharte hain. Jaise, hello, phir variable one yaani name, your

37
00:03:19.469 --> 00:03:23.371
Order, phir variable two yaani order I D, has been dispatched.

38
00:03:23.821 --> 00:03:29.580
Sample values. Har variable ke liye ek example value dijiye, taaki Meta ka reviewer

39
00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:30.967
Message samajh sake.

40
00:03:31.417 --> 00:03:36.340
Media. Image ya video header ke liye abhi asli file ki zaroorat nahin.

41
00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:39.716
Campaign bhejte samay asli image add karte hain.

42
00:03:40.166 --> 00:03:44.241
Footer. Neeche ek chhoti line, jaise Oribrix ki tagline.

43
00:03:44.691 --> 00:03:49.896
Aur language. Bahut saari Indian aur international languages available hain.

44
00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:56.322
Buttons se customers ke liye jawaab dena aasaan hota hai.

45
00:03:56.322 --> 00:03:57.804
Inke kuch types hain.

46
00:03:58.254 --> 00:04:03.048
Quick reply. One tap wale jawaab, jaise interested ya not interested.

47
00:04:03.048 --> 00:04:08.537
Reply vaapas live chat mein aata hai, taaki aapko pata ho ki unhonne kya chuna.

48
00:04:08.987 --> 00:04:14.704
Visit website. Ek button jo link kholta hai, jaise track order, ya download the app.

49
00:04:15.154 --> 00:04:20.231
Call phone. Ek button jo number call karta hai, jaise Oribrix support line.

50
00:04:20.681 --> 00:04:25.972
Aur talk to support quick reply, jo agent ke saath live chat shuru karta hai.

51
00:04:28.366 --> 00:04:33.401
Submit ke baad template, All section mein apne status ke saath dikhta hai.

52
00:04:33.851 --> 00:04:38.544
Pending. Meta review kar raha hai. Usually isme bas kuch minutes lagte hain.

53
00:04:38.994 --> 00:04:43.453
Approved. Ye campaigns mein aur API ke through use ke liye ready hai.

54
00:04:43.903 --> 00:04:49.062
Rejected. Reason padhiye, template theek kijiye, aur phir se submit kijiye.

55
00:04:49.062 --> 00:04:54.633
Common reasons hain galat category, sample values ka na hona, ya misleading text.

56
00:04:57.033 --> 00:05:02.473
Ye templates ka ek starter set hai jo Oribrix customer care roz use karega.

57
00:05:02.923 --> 00:05:05.995
Order confirmed, utility template ke roop men.

58
00:05:06.445 --> 00:05:09.517
Order dispatched, tracking link button ke saatha.

59
00:05:09.967 --> 00:05:14.042
Order delivered, feedback ke liye quick reply buttons ke saatha.

60
00:05:14.492 --> 00:05:17.180
Payment received, ya refund processed.

61
00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:23.681
Ek marketing template un customers ko vaapas laane ke liye jinhonne kaafi samay se

62
00:05:23.681 --> 00:05:24.862
Order nahi kiya.

63
00:05:25.312 --> 00:05:30.740
Aur zyadatar templates pe talk to support button, taaki customers kisi insan tak

64
00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:31.690
Pahunch saken.

65
00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:39.284
Quick check. Your order has been dispatched wala template kis category mein hona

66
00:05:39.284 --> 00:05:41.033
Chahiye? Ek second sochiye.

67
00:05:44.983 --> 00:05:50.778
Answer: utility. Ye ek zaroori update hai jiski customer ko ummid hai, promotion

68
00:05:50.778 --> 00:05:51.213
Nahin.

69
00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:56.560
Module two ko summarise karte hain.

70
00:05:57.010 --> 00:06:01.383
Customer ko pehla message approved template se hi jaana chahiye.

71
00:06:01.833 --> 00:06:05.567
Categories hain utility, marketing aur authentication.

72
00:06:06.017 --> 00:06:11.437
Body one thousand twenty four characters tak hoti hai, aur variables ke liye sample

73
00:06:11.437 --> 00:06:12.417
Values chahiye.

74
00:06:12.867 --> 00:06:17.048
Buttons quick replies, website links ya call button ho sakte hain.

75
00:06:17.498 --> 00:06:20.921
Aur template pending, approved ya rejected hota hai.

76
00:06:20.921 --> 00:06:23.621
Module three mein hum campaigns bhejenge.

77
00:06:26.033 --> 00:06:32.241
Module 2 yahin khatam hota hai. Agla hai module 3: Campaigns and automatic messages.
